   "source": [
    "# Customer Revenue Analytics & Behavioral Segmentation\n",
    "\n",
    "## Stage 1 — Transaction Analysis and Customer Feature Engineering\n",
    "\n",
    "### Objective\n",
    "\n",
    "Analyze historical e-commerce transaction data to understand customer purchasing behavior, revenue generation, basket characteristics, and return behavior.\n",
    "\n",
    "### Key Tasks\n",
    "\n",
    "- Load and inspect the transaction data\n",
    "- Clean and validate transaction records\n",
    "- Calculate transaction-level revenue\n",
    "- Aggregate transactions into customer-level features\n",
    "- Analyze purchase frequency, revenue, recency, basket value, and product behavior\n",
    "- Analyze customer return behavior\n",
    "- Create behavioral customer segments"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "8079d679",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Loading the necessary libraries"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "24d1dc53",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 1. Data Loading and Initial Inspection\n",
    "\n",
    "Load the historical e-commerce transaction data and inspect its structure, dimensions, columns, data types, and basic statistics.\n",
    "\n",
    "## 2. Data Cleaning and Validation\n",
    "\n",
    "Check for:\n",
    "- Missing values\n",
    "- Duplicate records\n",
    "- Invalid quantities\n",
    "- Invalid prices\n",
    "- Transaction consistency\n",
    "\n",
    "Clean the data before performing customer-level analysis.\n",
    "\n",
    "## 3. Transaction-Level Revenue Analysis\n",
    "\n",
    "Calculate the monetary value of each transaction line and analyze purchase and return transactions separately.\n",
    "\n",
    "## 4. Customer-Level Feature Engineering\n",
    "\n",
    "Aggregate transaction-level information by `UserID` to create customer-level behavioral features, including:\n",
    "\n",
    "- Purchase frequency\n",
    "- Gross revenue\n",
    "- Unique products\n",
    "- Average basket value\n",
    "- Recency\n",
    "- Return events\n",
    "- Return value\n",
    "- Return value rate\n",
    "\n",
    "## 5. Customer Behavioral Analysis\n",
    "\n",
    "Analyze customer purchasing patterns, revenue contribution, basket behavior, and return behavior.\n",
    "\n",
    "## 6. Behavioral Customer Segmentation\n",
    "\n",
    "Use the engineered customer-level features to classify customers into behavioral segments that can later support customer targeting."
   ]
  },
